# §6.2 window stack: drag the Command window's top border from (10,15) to
# (12,13) to move it, then drag its bottom-right corner (79,20) to (70,18)
# to resize it; release never triggers an action (§5.4).
mouse press 10 15 1
mouse drag 12 13 1
mouse release 12 13 1
mouse press 79 20 1
mouse drag 70 18 1
mouse release 70 18 1
eof
